          "page-title": "Apply for Dealer Direct Program",
          "description": "",
          "custom-html": "<div style=\"text-align: left; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto;\">\n  <h2>Program Benefits:</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n<strong>Discounts</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>23% discount on all PN’s first year</li>\n        <li>Additional +2% automatically added second year (25% total)</li>\n        <li>All discounts taken off published retail price</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n<strong>Guaranteed same or next day shipping on in-stock items</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Orders placed by 10:30am CST ship same day</li>\n        <li>Orders placed after 10:30am CST ship next day</li>\n        <li>For out-of-stock items, estimated ship date provided at time of order</li>\n        <li>Failure to meet guaranteed ship dates = free shipping</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>No buy-in, order minimum, or stocking required</li>\n    <li>Priority access to DW technical and product engineering team\n      <ul>\n        <li>Via phone or email</li>\n        <li>Immediate support or same-day follow-up</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>Listed as official dealer on DW website (after first full year in program)</li>\n    <li>Dedicated sales and service point of contact</li>\n    <li>Special discount rates for company-owned race or project vehicles\n      <ul>\n        <li>50% discount on up to $2,000 in product each year</li>\n        <li>Other sponsorship available through DW marketing team</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n    <li>No-questions-asked extended return and exchange timeline\n      <ul>\n        <li>90 days instead of standard 30 days</li>\n      </ul>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Eligibility Requirements:</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Business license reflecting company in the aftermarket performance industry</li>\n    <li>Located in lower 48 United States</li>\n    <li>Proof of brick-and-mortar commercial location</li>\n    <li>Installation and/or tuning services offered</li>\n    <li>Business established for at least 3 years</li>\n    <li>Minimum of $7,500 in annual purchases</li>\n    <li>Business in good standing within the industry</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>Terms and Conditions:</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li>In addition to <a href=\"https://www.deatschwerks.com/policies-terms\" target=\"_blank\">DeatschWerks standard terms and conditions</a>\n</li>\n    <li>Orders must ship to company address; no drop shipping</li>\n    <li>Credit card kept on file at DW for order processing</li>\n    <li>Payment due at time of order</li>\n    <li>All orders ship on DW FedEx or UPS account (no customer-provided shipping accounts)</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
        }
